    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "0946dd7bb682c581595f": "Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn't even last a day under my training regimen!  $B$BA $c who thinks $ghe's : she's; a warrior.  Ha!",
        "47c5c78ee3c9435d6363": "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more experienced before you can survive in Alterac Valley.",
        "4b9072171215ac7f708e": "I require warrior training.",
        "79299290db1f8884ea6e": "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?",
        "97802445b8908555b2ad": "Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn't even last a day under my training regimen!  $B$BA $c who thinks $ghe's : she's; a warrior.  Ha!",
        "cd9a301732e61b946fb6": "The big wars might be over, for now, but we still have to keep our skills sharp!"
      },
      "name": "Kelv Sternhammer",
      "subName": "Warrior Trainer",
